**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```
Exact-match via `==` (not substring); order preserved by iteration.

**`src/main.rs`** — `list` now parses `--tag <TAG>` from the argument tail and, when present, filters through `filter_by_tag`; otherwise it lists all notes (unchanged behavior). Unknown arguments to `list` are rejected.

